    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the year 2022, Lindoso Anomaly, the terrible oilyman, invaded gyms and bodybuilding stages worldwide with his evil oil...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But only these five bodybuilders can save the muscle world from the eternal oil: Torugu, Big Uncle, Philip Flango, Raymond and Stronger.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Muscle Apocalypse&quot; is a quick 2D platform shooter game inspired by memes from the Brazilian bodybuilding and fitness universe, with its main objective on making the player smile! This is a parody that combines comedy, bodybuilding, and fun, without using real names, images, or brands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CONTROLS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613930/extras/6cfd1d165338c535fc32088392eeb7f1.avif?t=1754511076\" width=616 height=288 /></span></p>",
